        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-CPM-QUADTREE-XCOM-THEOREMS-81-85.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-QUADTREE-XCOM-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH81-AST-PACKING-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH82-SUBMICRO-LOOKUP-OK  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH83-INMEMORY-EVAL-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH84-XCOM-ZEROCOPY-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH85-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-QUADTREE-PROOF-WITNESS   PIC 9(01) VALUE 0.
        PROCEDURE DIVISION.
        0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
            PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-QUADTREE-XCOM.
            GOBACK.
        1000-EVALUATE-QUADTREE-XCOM.
            IF WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR = 00256 AND
               WS-TH81-AST-PACKING-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH82-SUBMICRO-LOOKUP-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH83-INMEMORY-EVAL-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH84-XCOM-ZEROCOPY-OK = 1 AND
               WS-TH85-PARITY-CLOSURE-OK = 1
                MOVE 1 TO WS-QUADTREE-PROOF-WITNESS
            ELSE
                MOVE 0 TO WS-QUADTREE-PROOF-WITNESS.
